<title>USA: AMERICAN FOOTBALL-COLLEGE BOWL RESULTS WEDNESDAY.</title>
<headline>AMERICAN FOOTBALL-COLLEGE BOWL RESULTS WEDNESDAY.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of American college football bowl games played on Wednesday:</p>
<p>			  Rose Bowl</p>
<p> Ohio Sate		     20  Arizona State   17</p>
<p>			  Cotton Bowl</p>
<p> Brigham Young University  19  Kansas State   15</p>
<p>			  Citrus Bowl</p>
<p> Tennessee		     48  Northwestern   28</p>
<p>			  Gator Bowl</p>
<p> North Carolina		20  West Virginia  13</p>
<p>			  Outback Bowl</p>
<p> Alabama			 17  Michigan	 14</p>
<p>			  Fiesta Bowl</p>
<p> Penn State		    38  Texas	    15</p>
</text>
